    { "dot": "amber", "title": "Boundaries and gaps", "items": ["Forecasts start 2023-01-01T00:55 (history A inputs); 2022 is observations only", "The skipped spring-forward hour has no readings", "Deep link /replay?date&time&sensor&event; invalid parameters are ignored with a notice"] },
